{{Quote|Allows the user to manipulate ice, freezing their foes in place.|Shop}}
'''Ice''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Elemental]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|350,000}} or {{Robux|750}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]]. 

Ice allows the user to create, become, and manipulate ice—launching sharp, freezing projectiles and encasing enemies in solid ice. It can also create icy surfaces that freeze the ground and stun enemies. In tandem with this, it allows the user to effectively walk on water by freezing it below their feet, with its main rival being [[Flame]].

==Awakening==
Ice costs {{Fragment|14,500}} to fully [[Raids|awaken]].

Two [[Titles]] are unlocked upon awakening the first move from this fruit: "{{Title|The Ice Queen}}" #034 and "{{Title|The Ice King}}" #035.

