==Overview==
{{Tabber
|Unawakened|
{{Tabber
|Pros|
{{Overview|Pros|type=Unawakened
|'''General'''
* [[Elemental]] fruit (good for farming due to its immunity and stuns).
* Comes with an ice trident which is not affected by sword stats since it is scripted as a part of the fruit (similar to [[Light]]). This is good for fruit mains because they do not have to put stats in sword and also can deal damage to [[Blade]] users.
* All moves have good AoE and the [V] move covers a wide radius.
* Passive allows the user to walk on water.
* All moves are multi-target.
* Stuns are useful for [[Raids]], [[Bosses]], [[PvP]] and grinding [[Enemies]].
* Easily obtainable due to its low price.

|'''[Z] Ice Spears'''
* High range and decent explosion damage.
* Little bit stun.

|'''[X] Ice Surge'''
* No end-lag.

|'''[C] Ice Bird'''
* Launches faster than its awakened version though has less range in return.
* Freezes the enemy for 1-2 seconds (simillar to Ice's '''[V]''' move).

|'''[V] Glacial Epoch'''
* Large AoE.
* Freezes the enemy for 1-2 seconds (simillar to Ice's '''[C]''' move).
}}

|Cons|
{{Overview|Cons|type=Unawakened
|'''General'''
* [[Elemental]] Reflex is almost useless in the [[Third Sea|Third]] and [[Second Sea]], because most of the NPCs utilizes [[Aura]], which nullifies the [[Elemental]] reflex.
* The user can still get pushed into the water and drowned despite the passive.
* Weak fighting in air, since the majority of the moveset can't be used in the air.
* Low damage.

|'''[Z] Ice Spears'''
* Easy to dodge due to its small hitbox.

|'''[X] Ice Surge'''
* High knockback in grinding.
* Does not work in the air.
* Small hitbox compared to awakened version, having a hitbox two times smaller

|'''[C] Ice Bird'''
* Projectile moves slowly.
* Can be dodged if aimed directly.

|'''[V] Glacial Epoch'''
* Very easily punished.
* Cannot [[Dashing|dash]], [[Air Jump|air jump]], or use any other move until the ice defrosts.
}}
}}

|Awakened|
{{Tabber
|Pros|
{{Overview|Pros|type=Awakened
|'''General'''
* Excellent for PvP
* Amazing combo potential.
* Amazing stuns as most of its moves freeze the opponent.
* Decent damage.

|'''[Z] Cold Storm'''
* Decent stuns.
* Can push players and [[Enemies|enemies]] away.
* Can deal very high damage if aimed correctly.

|'''[X] Glacial Surge'''
* High AoE.
* Slight stun.
* No startup.

|'''[C] Frozen Dragon'''
* High range and AoE.
* High stun. (The longer the dragon travels, the longer the stun effect is)

|'''[V] Absolute Zero'''
* High AoE.
* Extremely high stun.
* No startup.
* Amazing combo potential.

|'''[F] Ice Skating'''
* Good mobility.
* Decent speed.
}}

|Cons|
{{Overview|Cons|type=Awakened
|'''General'''
* Medium to low damage compared to other awakaned fruits.
* Still relatively weak in air
* More limited stuns compared to fruits like [[Control]] or [[Blizzard]], however, it is much easier to use.

|'''[Z] Cold Storm'''
* Slow speed.
* Can be dodged easily. 
* Can be instinct-tricked.

|'''[X] Glacial Surge'''
* High knockback. (Even further than unawakened)
* Does not work in the air.

|'''[C] Frozen Dragon'''
* Slight end-lag.
* Easy to avoid, due to the slow travel speed.

|'''[V] Absolute Zero'''
* Cannot [[Dashing|dash]], [[Air Jump|air jump]], or use any other move until the ice defrosts.
* Can be punished if missed.

|'''[F] Ice Skating'''
* The lower the user's [[health]], the slower their speed.
* High [[energy]] usage on water. ([F] Ice Skating and dodging with the ice effect on water)
}}
}}
}}

==Trivia==
* {{Ability|Z}} used to be the Awakened '''[Z]''' move before it got reworked.
* Some skins can cause the trail of ice on [[water]] to be generated more slowly as players run.
* {{Ability|V|1}} shares the same name with the [[Skins#Aura Skins|Aura Skin]], {{Skin|Absolute Zero}}.
* Ice's trident can damage [[Blade]] users, as it is not classified as a [[Sword]].
* Other players can step on the ice created by the Frost Walker passive.
* Ice's Frost Walker Passive is somewhat similar to Minecraft's Frost Walker Enchantment.

